# Check text files out with LF everywhere, matching Prettier's endOfLine: lf
# (audit T2.9). Without this, Git on Windows (core.autocrlf=true) writes CRLF
# and `npm run format:check` reports every file. Binary files are detected by
# text=auto and left alone.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Vitest snapshots (kept explicit; covered by the rule above).
*.snap text eol=lf
